# Seifer Almasy attacking with Memnite is not attacking alone (CR 506.5), so nobody gains double strike: Seifer deals 3 once and
# Memnite 1 (Bot2 20 to 16). Fire Cross triggers on Seifer's combat damage: the Fiery Confluence in the graveyard (mana value 4,
# one past the limit) is refused as a target, the Lightning Bolt (1) is the one that can be chosen, and Bot1 declines the cast, so the
# Bolt stays in the graveyard and Bot2 stays at 16. Faithless Looting on turn 1 discards both cards, drawing Seifer and Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Fiery Confluence
Lightning Bolt
Seifer Almasy
Memnite
Mountain
Mountain x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Fiery Confluence; Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Seifer Almasy.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Seifer Almasy > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
! Bot1.Target(Fiery Confluence)
Bot1.Target(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Lightning Bolt; Fiery Confluence
